{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bea65111-a9cc-8f4b-b58f-8940a36ceba8",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:42:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sofia Silva",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:37:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:37:39-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. My name is Sofia Silva. I'm calling about the water at the bottom of my driveway. It's the same thing every time we get a real rain, and this last storm made it worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:37:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. Which storm, the one over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:38:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The nor'easter, Friday into Saturday. That was two days ago now. And it's still damp down there, I looked this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:38:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:38:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "219 Bliss Road. That's on the Easton's Beach side, if you know the area. Down toward the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:38:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know it. So tell me what you're seeing at the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:38:30-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Where the driveway meets the street, the apron, it dips. A puddle sits right there, a big one, and it doesn't go out to the street. It runs back toward my garage door. I had to put towels at the bottom of the door Saturday night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:38:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Did any water get inside the garage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:38:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little at the edge. Not a flood, I'm not saying that. But I shouldn't be putting towels down at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:39:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, understood. Has this happened before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:39:09-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, my neighbor, two doors up, told me it happens every big rain. She said it's been that way for years. So it's not new, and I'd like somebody to look at it before it gets worse. I'm asking who I call to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:39:30-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You called the right place. I'll put in a request for a crew to inspect the apron and see whether it's the grading or a drain nearby. Do you have photos by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:39:45-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do. I took pictures Saturday. And I learned how to take a screenshot just last week, so I'm very proud of that. I took one of the weather radar too, if that helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:40:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good for you. The pictures of the puddle are the useful ones. Is there an email you'd like to send them to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:40:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't want to give out my email over the phone. Can you just write down that I have photographs, and they can ask me when they come?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:40:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll note that you have photos available. And a callback number, in case the crew wants to reach you first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:40:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It's 401-555-0167."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:40:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 401-555-0167. Correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:40:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And it's a cell, so if I miss it, leave a message, please. I do listen to them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:40:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. And the house number again, two-one-nine Bliss Road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:40:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two nineteen, yes. Not two ninety. Last time somebody wrote it down wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:41:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two nineteen, thank you. Noted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:41:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Now, when will somebody come? Because the crews were out all weekend on the big roads, I understand that, but that puddle isn't going to fix itself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:41:16-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. After a storm like that we've got a stack of requests, so I'd say within the next week or so for a first look. If it turns out to be the drain, that's a different crew, and I'd let you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:41:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week. Well, all right. But if it rains again before then, I'm going to call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:41:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, call anytime. Just give them the request number. I'll give it to you now. Do you have something to write with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:41:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on, let me get a pen. Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:41:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's request 4-4-1-7. Four, four, one, seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:42:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four four one seven. Good. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:42:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Silva. Take care, and enjoy the rest of your afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:42:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
